{"articleNo":"240411","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=240411&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[장학] [근로]2020-2학기 학기중 부서별 근로장학생 모집 알림[8.13.~8.19.]","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2020.08.11","hit":"10417","attachments":[{"name":"2020학년도 부서별 근로장학생 배정내역(홈페이지).xlsx","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=240411&attachNo=90486"},{"name":"2020학년도 국가근로장학금 대학자체선발기준(금오공대)-8.14수정.pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=240411&attachNo=90510"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">1.&nbsp;신청하기&nbsp;전&nbsp;엑셀파일&nbsp;내용을&nbsp;반드시&nbsp;확인해&nbsp;주세요.&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 14pt;\">-&nbsp;엑셀&nbsp;안&nbsp;숫자는&nbsp;</span></strong></span><strong><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">배정시간</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">입니다.(배정인원&nbsp;아님)</span></strong></strong><br><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"> &nbsp;&nbsp;-&nbsp;토요일&nbsp;근무&nbsp;학생을&nbsp;선발하는&nbsp;부서에&nbsp;주말&nbsp;근무를&nbsp;\"N\"으로&nbsp;체크하거나,</span><br><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"> &nbsp;&nbsp;-&nbsp;야간&nbsp;근무&nbsp;학생을&nbsp;선발하는&nbsp;부서에&nbsp;근무&nbsp;가능시간을&nbsp;18시&nbsp;이전으로만&nbsp;기재하는&nbsp;경우가&nbsp;매&nbsp;신청&nbsp;시마다&nbsp;발생하고&nbsp;있습니다.</span><br><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"> &nbsp;&nbsp;-&nbsp;대학근로&nbsp;배정시간&nbsp;셀에&nbsp;메모를&nbsp;확인해&nbsp;주시기&nbsp;바랍니다.&nbsp;관련&nbsp;내용이&nbsp;기재되어&nbsp;있습니다.</span><br><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">2.&nbsp;근로장학종류_근로구분은&nbsp;엑셀파일&nbsp;A열을&nbsp;참고하시기&nbsp;바랍니다.​</span><br><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span><br><br><strong><br><br></strong><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">&lt; 2020학년도&nbsp;2학기&nbsp;학기중&nbsp;부서별&nbsp;근로장학생&nbsp;모집&nbsp;알림&gt;</span></strong></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span><br><strong><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255); font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">★&nbsp;신청기간:&nbsp;8.13.(목)&nbsp;10:00&nbsp;~8.19.(수)&nbsp;18:00&nbsp;까지&nbsp;</span><br><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255); font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">-&nbsp;주말포함&nbsp;신청가능,&nbsp;전화&nbsp;문의는&nbsp;평일&nbsp;근무기간&nbsp;시간 내&nbsp;가능</span><br><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255); font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">★&nbsp;2020-2학기&nbsp;재학생만&nbsp;신청가능합니다.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><br><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255); font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"> &nbsp;&nbsp;-&nbsp;학기&nbsp;중&nbsp;재학생으로&nbsp;학적&nbsp;유지</span><br><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255); font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">★&nbsp;근로시간,&nbsp;근무부서(희망근무장소)는&nbsp;예산&nbsp;사정&nbsp;등에&nbsp;의해서&nbsp;변경될&nbsp;수&nbsp;있습니다.</span><br><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255); font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">★&nbsp;계획이&nbsp;변경/추가되어&nbsp;추가&nbsp;모집이&nbsp;필요한&nbsp;경우&nbsp;추가&nbsp;모집&nbsp;공고를&nbsp;할&nbsp;수&nbsp;있습니다.&nbsp;&nbsp;(공지사항으로&nbsp;알림)</span></strong><br></strong><br><br><br><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">2020학년도&nbsp;2학기&nbsp;학기&nbsp;중&nbsp;부서별&nbsp;근로장학생을&nbsp;모집하오니&nbsp;희망하는&nbsp;학생은&nbsp;기간&nbsp;내에&nbsp;신청하시기&nbsp;바랍니다.</span><br><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">-&nbsp;근로장학생&nbsp;선발은&nbsp;선착순이&nbsp;아님을&nbsp;알려드립니다.</span><br><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">-&nbsp;신청자&nbsp;전체&nbsp;명단이&nbsp;신청기간&nbsp;후에&nbsp;각&nbsp;부서에&nbsp;일괄적으로&nbsp;통보됩니다.</span><br><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"> &nbsp;&nbsp;</span><br><strong><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255); font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 18pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Ⅰ.&nbsp;국가근로장학생</span><br><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">1.&nbsp;자격요건</span></strong></strong><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span><br><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"> &nbsp;가.&nbsp;2020-2학기&nbsp;재학생&nbsp;중&nbsp;한국장학재단&nbsp;국가근로장학금&nbsp;신청자&nbsp;중&nbsp;순위&nbsp;통과자</span><br><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1)&nbsp;1순위~3순위:&nbsp;국가근로&nbsp;신청가능</span><br><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-&nbsp;1순위:&nbsp;국가근로&nbsp;신청가능</span><br><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-&nbsp;2순위,&nbsp;3순위:&nbsp;국가근로&nbsp;신청가능하나,&nbsp;1순위자가&nbsp;근로배정인원보다&nbsp;적은&nbsp;경우&nbsp;등&nbsp;부득이한&nbsp;경우&nbsp;2순위→3순위&nbsp;순으로&nbsp;근로선발&nbsp;가능</span><br><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2)&nbsp;순위&nbsp;외:&nbsp;국가근로&nbsp;선발순위&nbsp;없음,&nbsp;국가근로&nbsp;신청불가​</span><br><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;※순위확인&nbsp;방법&nbsp;:&nbsp;한국장학재단에서&nbsp;확인&nbsp;(2020-2학기&nbsp;기준)</span><br><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(신청기간&nbsp;중에는&nbsp;원스톱서비스&nbsp;로그인→학생지원→근로장학생&nbsp;신청서&nbsp;제출에서도&nbsp;확인&nbsp;가능)</span><br><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"> &nbsp;나.&nbsp;정규학기&nbsp;내&nbsp;재학생&nbsp;(휴학생,&nbsp;초과학기자&nbsp;제외)</span><br><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"> &nbsp;다.&nbsp;소득&nbsp;정보&nbsp;확인:&nbsp;8분위&nbsp;이하</span><br><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">&nbsp; 라.&nbsp;직전학기&nbsp;성적&nbsp;70점/100점&nbsp;만점(평점&nbsp;1.6)&nbsp;이상</span><br><strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">2.&nbsp;신청기간</span></strong></strong><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">2020.</span><strong><font color=\"#0900ff\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">8.13.(목)&nbsp;10:00&nbsp;~8.19.(수)&nbsp;18:00&nbsp;까지</span></font></strong><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></span><br><strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">3.&nbsp;근로기간</span></strong></strong><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">2020.9.1.(화)~2020.12.20.(일)&nbsp;[학기&nbsp;중]</span><br><strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">4.&nbsp;부서&nbsp;신청방법</span></strong></strong><br><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">&nbsp;가.&nbsp;온라인&nbsp;신청방법:&nbsp;원스톱서비스&nbsp;로그인&nbsp;-&nbsp;학생지원&nbsp;-&nbsp;근로장학생&nbsp;신청서&nbsp;제출</span><br><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-&nbsp;신청&nbsp;상세내역작성(계좌등록,&nbsp;근무부서,&nbsp;희망&nbsp;부서&nbsp;및&nbsp;희망근무시간&nbsp;입력)&nbsp;</span><br><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-&nbsp;신청버튼&nbsp;클릭&nbsp;-&nbsp;완료</span><br><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">&nbsp;나.&nbsp;국가근로&nbsp;선발기준:&nbsp;붙임 참고</span><br><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">&nbsp;다.&nbsp;근무부서,&nbsp;희망근무장소&nbsp;:&nbsp;붙임&nbsp;참고&nbsp;(반드시&nbsp;파일확인&nbsp;후&nbsp;신청하세요)</span><br><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">&nbsp;라.&nbsp;희망근무시간(가능한&nbsp;시간&nbsp;모두&nbsp;기재)</span><br><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1)&nbsp;시간&nbsp;입력시&nbsp;시간단위는&nbsp;24시간으로&nbsp;기재(오후&nbsp;3시일&nbsp;경우&nbsp;→&nbsp;15:00으로&nbsp;입력)</span><br><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;ex)&nbsp;월:13:00~15:00/&nbsp;화:11:00~12:00,&nbsp;15:00~17:00/&nbsp;수:14:00~18:00/&nbsp;목:&nbsp;없음/&nbsp;금:&nbsp;9:00~13:00</span><br><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2)&nbsp;반드시&nbsp;수업시간을&nbsp;제외한&nbsp;근로가능시간을&nbsp;입력해야&nbsp;함</span><br><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">&nbsp;마.&nbsp;모두&nbsp;입력&nbsp;후&nbsp;신청버튼&nbsp;클릭~!&nbsp;별도&nbsp;제출서류&nbsp;없음</span><br><strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">5.&nbsp;선발일정</span></strong></strong><br><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">가.&nbsp;학생&nbsp;:&nbsp;희망근무부서&nbsp;신청</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">[</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">2020.</span><strong><font color=\"#0900ff\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">8.13.(목)&nbsp;10:00&nbsp;~8.19.(수)&nbsp;18:00</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></span></font></strong></span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">까지]</span></span><br><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">나.&nbsp;각&nbsp;해당부서&nbsp;:&nbsp;각&nbsp;부서에서&nbsp;희망근무부서&nbsp;신청자&nbsp;명단을&nbsp;확인하여&nbsp;해당&nbsp;학생에게&nbsp;연락&nbsp;확인&nbsp;후&nbsp;추천</span><br><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">다.&nbsp;학생처&nbsp;:&nbsp;근로장학생&nbsp;선발확정(예정)&nbsp;[2020.8.28.(금)]</span><br><strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">6.&nbsp;근로장학금액</span></strong></strong><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">&nbsp;:&nbsp;근로&nbsp;다음달&nbsp;10일&nbsp;지급(10일이&nbsp;주말일&nbsp;경우&nbsp;금요일에&nbsp;지급)</span><br><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">&nbsp;가.&nbsp;교내일반&nbsp;:&nbsp;시간당&nbsp;급여&nbsp;9,000원</span><br><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">&nbsp;나.&nbsp;교외일반&nbsp;:&nbsp;시간당&nbsp;급여&nbsp;11,150원</span><br><br><br><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">--------------------------------------------------------------------------------</span><br><br><br><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><strong><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255); font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">Ⅱ.&nbsp;대학근로장학생</span></strong></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span><br><strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">1.&nbsp;자격요건</span></strong></strong><br><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">&nbsp;가.&nbsp;2020-2학기&nbsp;재학생&nbsp;중&nbsp;직전학기&nbsp;성적&nbsp;70점/100점&nbsp;만점(평점&nbsp;1.6)&nbsp;이상</span><br><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">&nbsp;나.&nbsp;정규학기&nbsp;내&nbsp;재학생&nbsp;(휴학생,&nbsp;초과학기자&nbsp;제외)</span><br><strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">2.&nbsp;신청기간</span></strong></strong><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">2020.</span><font color=\"#0900ff\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><stron